Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] lifecycle guard: move _split_logical_lines to
 cron/lifecycle_guard_lines.py (FILE_LINES offset)

The cat-relay fix grows cron/lifecycle_guard.py past its 2000-line target after main's clustered shell -c change (915aebe6ac7). Move the dependency-free logical-line splitter, unchanged, into a topical sibling; lifecycle_guard re-imports it under the same name.
